# Employee Management System

A full-stack Employee Management System built using Node.js, Express, MongoDB, and Electron. This application helps manage employees, tasks, teams, and projects within an organization.

## Features

### Authentication
- User signup and login with JWT authentication
- Company-based access control using `company_id` and `passkey`

### Task Management
- Add, view, and delete tasks
- Prevent overlapping tasks
- Time tracking with start and end time
- Weekly work summary visualization (Chart.js)

### Team Management
- Create and delete teams
- Assign members to teams
- View team statistics and member roles

### Project Management
- Create, update, and delete projects
- Assign projects to teams
- Track project status (todo, in progress, completed)
- Visual project board with drag-like status updates

### Request System
- Submit requests (leave, vacation, compensation, etc.)
- Includes title, details, and date range

### Dashboard
- Overview of teams, members, and active projects
- Clean UI with dark theme

### Desktop App
- Built using Electron for desktop usage
- Smooth navigation between pages

---

## Tech Stack

**Frontend:**
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Chart.js

**Backend:**
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB (Mongoose)

**Desktop:**
- Electron

**Authentication:**
- JWT (JSON Web Tokens)
- bcrypt (password hashing)

